{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Invalidates the specified offline pack. This method checks that the tiles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the specified offline pack match those from the server. Local tiles that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"do not match the latest version on the server are updated.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:"}],"role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","text":"MLNOfflinePack","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pack","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" (^)(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","text":"NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *","kind":"text"},{"text":"","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platform